      "message": "fix(ui): readable locate mates and hints\n\nThe locate form's mates read in plain words in the fixture's setup\nframe (a face by its outward normal and number, a point by its\ncoordinates; app::fixture_locate::read_pick), not raw feature ids. The\nNext hint offers Apply only when the solve accepts the draft, else it\nsays why; the refusal stands on its own line under Apply, zero mates\nincluded. The offset names its frame and the turn its mate and positive\nsense on wrapped lines (the label column truncated them). A fixture pick\nwhile a part face is wanted says to hide the fixture to reach part faces\ninside it. The drafted picks' viewport outlines are now pinned.\n\nPinned by locate_tests (the_mates_read_in_plain_words_and_stay_drawn,\na_refused_draft_says_why_instead_of_offering_apply), fixture_rows and\nstructural.\n\nRefs #561\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAgjpiZbXSvmXLvdmL",
