      "message": "fix(ui): a locate draft whose form is off screen is dropped, so it never captures picks\n\nReview of #566: once a located draft kept its mates (fde19af4), only\n\"Stop locating\" ended it, and the viewport routing that sends Face and\nVertex picks to a live draft kept doing so after the page was left - an\noperation's face pick then read \"'X' is neither the part nor the\nfixture\" with no form on screen. The shell now resets\nState::locate_form_drawn before the dock, the form sets it, and\nlocate_pick::sweep drops any draft whose form was not drawn that frame\n(page left, active setup changed, pane closed).\n\nPinned by locate_tests::leaving_the_page_drops_a_located_draft (on the\npage the located draft stays for Offset edits; off it, it is gone).\n\nRefs #561\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CUsqDAAAJyAPrC37zBzbbX",
